def build_trieu(c,t,v="v0"):
    pal,face=DATA[c]; rk,sc,sh,sp,motif,head=TRIEU[t]; mc,mh,dc,dh=TRIEU_MAIN
    s=PRE+f" An imperial consort{', the Empress' if t==8 else ''}. Her face: {face}. From the identity reference keep ONLY her face, facial features and hairstyle colour; do NOT copy the outfit, hair ornaments or accessories of the reference, dress her in the NEW outfit below. The style reference image is only for skin, drawing style, fabric and embroidery: never copy its face, body or pose. {AGE_TXT[AGE]}"
    s+=f" Outfit ({rk}, in {TRIEU_CUT}): a NEW outfit, the stiff structured shoulder piece (cầu vai) is {sp}, its edge: {TRIEU_EDGE[t]}; {motif}; {head}; the robe itself is clearly {mc}, floor-length with slippers visible, slim tall silhouette."
    s+=f" COLOUR RULE: all colours fresh, clear and luminous, never dusty or greyed; the COMMON main colour of the court uniform, the same at every rank, is {mc} like {mh}, the main colour of the robe and sleeves, with {dc} like {dh} in the linings and belt; the secondary colour {sc} like {sh} is the colour of the shoulder pieces, the collar-and-cuff band, the shawl and the sash, and it shows her rank; "
    if t>=7: s+=f"the yellow is {YEL_NEW}; "
    s+="the crown, hairpin and jewellery gold in the same 18K tone; gold only as thin accents on the borders; this uniform colour belongs to the court, it is NOT her own signature colour."
    if t<7: s+=" Hair: her own hairstyle decorated as described, rich like her rank. No phoenix anywhere on the robe or in the hair: only flowers, birds, butterflies, clouds or other motifs. All embroidery is light, clean and well spaced, fine silk-thread embroidery stitched directly into the fabric, flat and integrated with the cloth, following its folds, not appliqué, not pasted patches, not raised, never dense all-over flowers. "+FAB
    else: s+=" The phoenix is the main embroidered motif, larger and more prominent than the flowers. All embroidery is clean and well spaced, fine silk-thread embroidery stitched directly into the fabric, flat and integrated with the cloth, following its folds, not appliqué, not pasted patches, not raised, never dense all-over flowers. "+FAB
    s+=" Pose: calm formal court standing pose, no held item; her hands folded formally in front of her at waist height with the wide sleeves falling over them, upright dignified posture, body turned very slightly three-quarters, the whole face fully visible, head up facing the viewer, eyes open, lips closed, never looking down."
    s+=" Every hairpin is inserted into the hair pointing upward or backward with dangles hanging down, no hairpin horizontal or sticking out to the side. Luminous smooth porcelain skin, bare clean forehead with no forehead mark and no flower mark, eyes open, floor-length robe with slippers visible, no train, no cup, nothing covering the face."
    return s+END
